#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotixi2c.rst:5
#: 1b8d49abfc394cf7b0cae3ce042b3896 73c5bb562bbe4fc3a2745e7409554799
#: 9729d632fff947d5b5b28a4c9164a6b9 cc13e473a92d4e41b0b0d33748c551c3
#: f9ee83d553e54108b9b281cb7320eb5a
msgid "Maxbotix I2C Sonar Rangefinder"
msgstr "Maxbotix I2C 声呐测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotixi2c.rst:7
#: 4d09751f9e744d25aa52df03a87776a2 5038da7f710f48d5b9a2420f69d4dc58
#: 7e32566bd18c4caf802aa735485143bc 8790b5049758419084c30c9cece925db
#: d7c3b9ff341944cd8711eaba878b0683
msgid ""
"`Maxbotix I2C EZ4 <https://www.maxbotix.com/product-category/i2cxl-maxsonar-"
"ez-products>`__ sonar (also known as the I2CXL-MaxSonar-EZ4 or MB1242) is a "
"relatively inexpensive, short range (up to 7m) range finder primarily "
"designed for indoor use but which has been successfully used outdoors on "
"Copter."
msgstr ""
"`Maxbotix I2C EZ4 <https://www.maxbotix.com/product-category/i2cxl-maxsonar-"
"ez-products>`__ 声呐（又称 I2CXL-MaxSonar-EZ4 或 MB1242）是一款价格相对低廉、量程较短（最大 "
"7m）的测距仪，主要为室内使用设计，但也已成功用于 Copter 的室外环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotixi2c.rst:12
#: 02e4b132bea74d81b5bf74d76c989375 7272b7ec43304b42968be760cbd6415a
#: 86087d0347c84e209d2eb65eed2bd57c 9df7fe1003904740bd0c65eba94a8a84
#: bf4ada0d1f8b4f2fb7a98193744e5fac
msgid ""
"The EZ4 (recommended) has the narrowest beam providing the best noise "
"resistance while the EZ0 has the widest beam and highest sensitivity. `The "
"datasheet can be found here <https://www.maxbotix.com/documents/I2CXL-"
"MaxSonar-EZ_Datasheet.pdf>`__. Additional information on the similar "
":ref:`analog version of this sonar can be found here <copter:sonar>`."
msgstr ""
"EZ4（推荐）波束最窄，抗干扰性最佳；EZ0 波束最宽，灵敏度最高。`数据手册可在此处获取 "
"<https://www.maxbotix.com/documents/I2CXL-MaxSonar-EZ_Datasheet.pdf>`__。有关类似"
" :ref:`模拟版声呐的更多信息可在此处获取 <copter:sonar>` 。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotixi2c.rst:20
#: 0c50686074644a2e99585d82f938a51a 415a32da8b0747099e621a11ea3d5dd2
#: b295e3a6b48649c9b5f05db59560dc02 b7aa4d14c77a4ad7900626efdbf23d90
#: bf07b66a0ba74cbcb88876cab2e17cc2
msgid ""
"``RNGFNDx_MAX`` must be set to a tested, appropriate value.  If "
"``RNGFNDx_MAX`` is set to a value greater than the range of the sensor, the "
"autopilot will not respond correctly to the data provided."
msgstr ""
"``RNGFNDx_MAX`` 必须设置为经过测试的合适值。若 ``RNGFNDx_MAX`` "
"设置为超出传感器量程的值，飞控将无法正确响应所提供的数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotixi2c.rst:25
#: 61df832059644523be047e9f59e10f18 d53eacc0bd66444d916956d4a4838344
#: e541ad0b8b274fb290572a601a2453a3 f3d3b3d4153e42689e90ab47c6721f88
#: f72b9e90feef44d4a6e3b5f211c86dc6
msgid "Connecting to the Pixhawk"
msgstr "连接至 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotixi2c.rst:27
#: 1675066bf3ec4e2a864a98ef043b58e2 2563b16075fe46b5b00572d7c5c168f7
#: 927bfce5c52741a481a77c4d61d03556 b110e628a9bf49249e577e5d7ce33f88
#: c891985f843d43188257a3e588a2b5c4
msgid ""
"The sonar should be connected to the Pixhawk's I2C port as shown below or "
"alternatively through an I2C expansion board. The Pixhawk will provide the "
"regulated 5V power supply the sensor requires."
msgstr ""
"声呐应连接至 Pixhawk 的 I2C 接口，如下图所示，也可通过 I2C 扩展板连接。Pixhawk 将为传感器提供所需的稳压 5V 电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotixi2c.rst:35
#: 119a4b1981d3420c98aea7dd641bf1d4 31ff1272306a4fc2b1b9fc841e567c53
#: 8ab8c1c1f8bf4a89b1ad482ddfc74db2 b212370ae1d945afb040c42e96ca5bd2
#: fe78d77e14004cc1afa2c8485b20e35e
msgid "Setup through the mission planner"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotixi2c.rst:37
#: 4b1477e0cf3c4846895f0e482f01b0cf 4e3b96b22293439d8b09b895857048e6
#: 8a55cab423bc46ceada9c6eeb89b581b a5f3840ed2144b7ab0cf4ed51dfdb387
#: d154b00f00064116a491c0159aaf62b6
msgid ""
"To configure Copter, Plane or Rover to use the Maxbotix I2C, please first "
"connect with the Mission Planner and then open the Config/Tuning >> Full "
"Parameter List page and set the following parameters (example below is if it"
" is first rangefinder):"
msgstr ""
"如需配置 Copter、Plane 或 Rover 使用 Maxbotix I2C，请先连接 Mission Planner，然后打开「配置/调参 >>"
" 完整参数列表」页面，设置以下参数（示例为第一个测距仪）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotixi2c.rst:41
#: 19b84dd5fa774960928f8674b3298a79 3036899811bf4fe2ba6fad6d07babed2
#: 4a55a29545234180b0fba4dbd3e416a5 671d7f86bf4241cea2c038867d24ddda
#: aa5105a54b474f8c9e88929d472b414d
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` = \"7\" (i.e. 7m max range)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` = 「7」（即最大量程 7m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotixi2c.rst:42
#: 3b7f62e080394d798fdc818e240064a9 4e90f86a08f34b13bb5c94d65223a1bc
#: 5973de3318064284b51497cbc61cf930 987abb22d10741059995ab34e6d426cc
#: ca88f707414c47b285332111f5fc8baf
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = “2\" (MaxbotixI2C sonar)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 「2」（MaxbotixI2C 声呐）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotixi2c.rst:48
#: 0f4b9680ed4d43f4bf7dc1b283c79637 18e7e2e9ef9049e8a5703791f7b3723d
#: 1c26d75a86484a2f89b6919484ab98ad 6696a890c4204092ad2324ce179dfea2
#: db2c87e2a0d148a48a8efa13221ccdea
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotixi2c.rst:50
#: 2d7d3d2eb04c429dba5fb171cd278e76 a19b75ac41284bafa99ac920db03533c
